  "body": "Titles have now been issued.\r\n\r\nOffering the independence of a fully detached home in a premium Bucklands Beach setting, Home 5 at 198 Bucklands Beach Road combines privacy, generous proportions, sea views and future flexibility in a home ideally suited to both downsizers and families.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 163sqm across two levels, Home 5 sits apart from the rest of the collection and delivers a particularly appealing combination of indoor space, outdoor living and additional parking.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor has been designed around relaxed everyday living. A spacious lounge connects naturally with the open-plan kitchen and dining area, where 2.7m stud heights enhance the feeling of light and volume. From here, the home flows seamlessly onto a hardwood rear deck and generous grassed outdoor area, creating a rare amount of usable outdoor space for a new home in this location.\r\n\r\nThe premium designer kitchen provides the functional heart of the home, with generous workspace and a layout designed equally well for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four inviting bedrooms provide flexibility for family, guests or working from home. The master suite is the standout, complete with an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and beautiful sea outlook over Eastern Beach. Three additional bedrooms and a beautifully finished family bathroom complete the upper level.\r\n\r\nA large single garage with storage, dedicated laundry and additional off-street park add valuable everyday practicality, while lift provision future-proofs the home for buyers planning for long-term ease and accessibility.\r\n\r\nFinished in a premium combination of Nu-Wall aluminium cladding, weatherboard and brick, Home 5 combines strong architectural character with low-maintenance coastal living.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\n- Titles issued\r\n- Approximately 163sqm floor area\r\n- Fully detached home\r\n- Four bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n- Master suite with ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and sea view over Eastern Beach\r\n- Premium designer kitchen\r\n- Spacious open-plan dining and living\r\n- 2.7m stud height on the lower level\r\n- Generous hardwood rear deck\r\n- Large grassed outdoor area\r\n- Large single garage with storage\r\n- One additional off-street park\r\n- Dedicated laundry\r\n- Lift provision for future accessibility\r\n- Fully tiled bathrooms with rainhead showers\r\n- Premium Nu-Wall aluminium, weatherboard and brick exterior\r\n- Moments from Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach\r\n- Located in the sought-after Macleans College zone\r\n- Stamford 10-year Building Warranty\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact the Urban Haus team.\r\n\r\nFor new releases, project updates and behind-the-scenes content, follow @urbanhausnz on Instagram and Facebook.",
